  "priorExpiration": "2004-10-05",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 203.01 Filing of Documents with the Board. A document shall be considered properly filed when it is actually received by the office of legislation and hearings or the hearing officer, and conforms to the requirements of this chapter.\n\nSource. #2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84; ss by #4851, eff 6-25-90; ss by #6348, eff 10-5-96, EXPIRED: 10-5-04\n\nNew. #8334-A, eff 4-23-05 (from Ed 207.01)",
